With the LocalDbDAO and Message class, create a small application using Spring 5 MVC pattern. It needs to have a controller class. It also needs to have two JSPs, one for creating a message (a form for the user to input the message information), use the GenerateMessageId class for the message id generation. That same JSP should display the list of messages from the latest to the first one. Each of the listed messages should have buttons for editing and deleting the message. The second JSP is for editing the message, with an apply update and cancel button. Please add css and javascript as needed.